{"episodes":{"207561":"Weak southwesterly mean layer winds set up well in advanced of an approaching strong cold front over the eastern Gulf, resulting in convective cloud line development near the Lower Florida Keys.  A waterspout developed just offshore Smathers Beach of Key West.","207564":"A strong cold front moved through the area on November 9th with the first freeze of the season behind it. Ahead of the front, there was sufficient instability, shear, and steep lapse rates for scattered thunderstorms, some of which produced large hail and damaging wind gusts. Most of the hail and wind was confined to southwest Georgia, but a couple of reports occurred in Jackson county, FL.","207565":"A strong cold front moved through the area on November 9th with the first freeze of the season behind it. Ahead of the front, there was sufficient instability, shear, and steep lapse rates for scattered thunderstorms, some of which produced large hail and damaging wind gusts across portions of southwest and south central Georgia.","208397":"A narrow ribbon of deeper moisture forced up by the deep west-southwest flow combined with bulk shear values of 40-50 knots helped develop a couple of strong to severe thunderstorms across southeast Georgia ahead of an approaching strong cold front.","208886":"Severe storms developed across southwest Alabama and produced large hail.","208887":"Severe storms moved across northwest Florida and produced large hail."},"events":[{"begin":"2025-11-09T14:40Z","county":"Baldwin","damageCrops":"0.00K","deaths":0,"end":"2025-11-09T14:42Z","endLat":30.71,"endLon":-87.59,"episode":208886,"id":1301041,"injuries":0,"lat":30.71,"location":"7.96 NNW Taylors Camp","lon":-87.59,"magnitude":1.25,"source":"Broadcast Media","state":"AL","type":"Hail","wfo":"MOB"},{"begin":"2025-11-09T15:00Z","county":"Escambia","damageCrops":"0.00K","deaths":0,"end":"2025-11-09T15:02Z","endLat":30.6893,"endLon":-87.3557,"episode":208887,"id":1301043,"injuries":0,"lat":30.6893,"loc